error[E0277]: `Cons<A, Cons<B, notko_hlist::Empty>>` does not hold every member of `u8`
  --> tests/compile_fail/a_subset_that_is_not_a_list_is_refused.rs:20:17
   |
20 |     holds_all::<Two, u8>();
   |                 ^^^ the trait `ContainsAll<u8>` is not implemented for `Cons<A, Cons<B, notko_hlist::Empty>>`
